# Docs placement

Do not add product how-tos, validation reports, or brew runbooks under git
`docs/`. Put those in `/home/agent/.local/share/sbx-kit/portable/docs/`.

Git markdown stays next to the code it describes and stays one-screen
(kit/template/cli READMEs). The root README stays an abstract blurb.

CLI help is the user-facing reference. If behavior changed, update
`sbx-kit --help` / `sbx-kit concepts`, not a new markdown file.
